  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The ILeadPeace: Building Resilient Communities in East Africa through Youth Advocacy and Democratic Citizenship project focuses on strengthening youth-led advocacy, democratic citizenship, and social cohesion across Kenya, Uganda, Tanzania, South Sudan, and Ethiopia. Its intervention strategy leverages youth engagement, digital technology, and faith-based partnerships to enhance governance and conflict resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
